#: filetypesview.cpp:83
msgid "Known Types"
msgstr "Tipus coneguts"

#: filetypesview.cpp:90
msgid ""
"Here you can see a hierarchical list of the file types which are known on your "
"system. Click on the '+' sign to expand a category, or the '-' sign to collapse "
"it. Select a file type (e.g. text/html for HTML files) to view/edit the "
"information for that file type using the controls on the right."
msgstr ""
"Aquí podetz veire ua lista ieràrquica de los tipus de fiquièrs coneguts sus "
"vostre sistemo. Cliquetz sus la sinha '+' per expandir ua categoria, on sus lo "
"signe '-' per contreure-la. Seleccionetz un tipus de fiquièr (p.ex. text/html "
"per a fiquièrs HTML) per veire o editar la informacion d'aquest tipus de "
"fiquièr usant los controls de la dreta."

